<title>NEW ZEALAND: W&amp;K ups stake in Fruitfed.</title>
<headline>W&amp;K ups stake in Fruitfed.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Williams and Kettle Ltd said on Monday it had lifted its stake in Fruitfed Supplies Ltd to 31.04 percent from 25.85 percent.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
